#: ../../tools/iptmnet_tools.rst:32 c636ab9de6fb4e4c8bdda5bd43ced753
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get proteoform records for a protein from iPTMnet. "
"Proteoforms represent specific combinations of PTM sites on a protein, as"
" defined by the PRO ontology. Each proteoform has a PRO ID, modified "
"sites, the responsible enzyme (if known), source database, and PubMed "
"references. Useful for understanding which specific PTM combinations have"
" been experimentally observed. Use with UniProt accession (e.g., P04637 "
"for TP53)."
msgstr ""

