#: ../../tools/iptmnet_tools.rst:67 572936a2abc4430aa39c3b1421adba1a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get PTM-dependent protein-protein interactions from "
"iPTMnet. Returns interactions where a post-translational modification on "
"one protein affects its binding to another protein. Each interaction "
"includes the PTM type, modified substrate with site position, the "
"interacting partner, association type (association/dissociation), data "
"source, and PubMed reference. Essential for understanding how PTMs "
"regulate protein interaction networks. Use with UniProt accession (e.g., "
"P04637 for TP53)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/iptmnet_tools.rst:77 127cc8a7db664bd5b333fd4a9613ba7c
msgid ""
"``ptm_type`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by PTM type: "
"Phosphorylation, Acetylation, Ubiquitination, Methylation. Case-"
"insensitive. Omit to return all types."
msgstr ""

