msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/iptmnet_tools.rst:97 4c6bbd6aa2824d4c95b20a9678b80771
msgid ""
"Get all post-translational modification (PTM) sites for a protein from "
"iPTMnet. Returns residue, ..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/iptmnet_tools.rst 26479d4fd0e448a68ce377a9318f79c9
msgid "iPTMnet_get_ptm_sites tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/iptmnet_tools.rst:103 b6c295f08e5c483a9fd724e425162cb1
msgid "**Name**: ``iPTMnet_get_ptm_sites``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/iptmnet_tools.rst:105 0f87df8f1d214af689dc5c2728b0ae8f
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get all post-translational modification (PTM) sites for "
"a protein from iPTMnet. Returns residue, position, PTM type, confidence "
"score, source databases, catalytic enzymes, and PubMed references for "
"each site. Data aggregated from PhosphoSitePlus, UniProt, and text "
"mining. Covers phosphorylation, acetylation, ubiquitination, methylation,"
" glycosylation, sumoylation, and more. Results organized by protein "
"isoform. Use with UniProt accession (e.g., P04637 for TP53)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/iptmnet_tools.rst:112 7231b0b3337a4a12beba62b04567692e
msgid ""
"``uniprot_id`` (string) (required) UniProt accession, e.g., P04637 "
"(TP53), P00533 (EGFR), P31749 (AKT1), Q16539 (MAPK14/p38)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/iptmnet_tools.rst:115 1759c5566dd249ac9174aef83adc7b28
msgid ""
"``ptm_type`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by PTM type: "
"Phosphorylation, Acetylation, Ubiquitination, Methylation, Sumoylation, "
"N-Glycosylation, O-Glycosylation, S-Nitrosylation. Case-insensitive. Omit"
" to return all types."
msgstr ""

